{"v":4,"catch":"Raze Hell","desc":"『DOOM 64』でDOOM25周年を祝おう。1997年にNINTENDO 64で発売された本作が、任天堂ゲーム機に再び帰ってくる。家でも外でも地獄との戦いに挑め！\n\nマザーデーモンを打ち倒すため、数々のデーモンと戦いながら地獄の侵略を食い止めろ。デーモンの脅威に終止符を打つための強力な武器と秘密を探し、怒涛の迫力で展開する30以上のレベルを戦い抜け。","publisher":"ベセスダ・ソフトワークス","release":"2020-03-26","genres":["射擊","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英語","スペイン語","フランス語","ドイツ語","イタリア語"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"D","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/297b3be6dbb958362c780d67cd02512ec40ac1aebb28f39e50fc1132126389fa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f9bf1281647247c810d8a48677762fe504cb0f1ecc4aeabaca12ff5d9ff6f505.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ad55542ee75c604575d1c005543b3d7ee54077e10dda48b812121cb2f5f3d903.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e8ca4c8a307d6114d7d47ca8a964b86f93d6703c6a175fc16d5faf7f13dfed76.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2b16e23cef981f9cb8cb897af3b5768b9831ae7181b681bde7e72a496db41e8e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b4453381db734ed02bf41eda85bab3af45e38480a1813f2e3c3a6ea809447589.jpg"],"titleId":"01005d700e742000"}